// Page 10 integrated readout output wrapper.
//
// Composes the visually checked READOUT_D0-READOUT_D15 slices into one
// local boundary. The old grouped T34 selector/data boundary vectors are
// resolved inside their slice modules; this wrapper keeps only the remaining
// scalar source rails and physical PINxx_IN split-input rails explicit. The
// READOUT_D0/D9 local D24 preprocessors are wired to the visually traced
// REG4_D4_BUF2/REG4_D3_BUF3 inverter rails, shared preprocessing rails, GND,
// and PINxx_IN sources. The READOUT_D10/D11 R118A/P136A T34 groups are
// resolved locally from traced V1N/D24/V2B preprocessing cells. The
// READOUT_D10/D11 H71A/H76A preprocessing is resolved locally from visible
// PIN13/PIN156 inputs and shared page-10 coordinate rails. The
// READOUT_D12/D13 P127A/P123 T34 groups and H92B/J109B preprocessing are
// likewise resolved locally. The READOUT_D14/D15 R114/R129A T34 groups plus
// H141A/J56A/H138B/H71B preprocessing are resolved locally from traced
// helpers, shared rails, explicit PINxx sources, and GND.
// The READOUT_D6/D7 G144/G130A T34 groups are resolved locally from
// dot-traced J122A/G114A source rails, which remain boundary ports until their
// source cells are modeled. The READOUT_D0/D1 G126/G139A T34 groups are also
// resolved locally from visible pin/V1N/D24/V2B sources and the shared
// J122A/G114A rails. The READOUT_D2/D3 G156/G151A T34 groups are resolved
// from the same shared source rails and adjacent D24/V2B preprocessing cells.
// The READOUT_D4/D5 G118A/G135 T34 groups are resolved from local V1N and
// D24/V2B preprocessing plus the adjacent D6/D7 F127B/G103B helpers. The
// READOUT_D8-D13 helper rails are now sourced locally from the visible
